    "caption_zone": 180,
    "radius": 8,
    "stroke": 2,
    "offset": 0,
    "tilt": "0deg",
    "shadow": "none",
    "tex_opacity": 0,
    "ink_width": 5,
    "cap_radius": 6,
    "composition": [
      "公式在上 30%，圖形在下 60%，兩者用同色連結",
      "大量深色留白，一次只亮一個式子",
      "座標軸用 ink-2 細線"
